{"availability":"available","full":"WowkDigital/organic_pattern_generator","name":"organic_pattern_generator","description":"An interactive, high-performance web application that generates organic, blob-like patterns using physics simulations and procedural generation. The project features real-time interactivity, generative audio, and advanced customization options for creative coding enthusiasts.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-16T18:10:44Z","updated":"2026-03-16T22:06:00Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://wowkdigital.github.io/organic_pattern_generator/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:44.968Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:44.968Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:44.968Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:22:44.968Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An interactive, high-performance web application that generates organic, blob-like patterns using physics simulations and procedural generation. The project features real-time interactivity, generative audio, and advanced customization options for creative coding enthusiasts.","Organic Pattern Generator is a browser-based art tool that utilizes D3.js for force-directed simulations and HTML5 Canvas for efficient rendering. It creates fluid, multi-layered shapes that react to mouse or touch input. The application includes a built-in audio engine that produces \"bubble\" sounds mapped to the size and movement of the organic shapes, providing a multi-sensory experience."],"features":["Physics-Based Animation: Uses d3-force for collision detection, gravity, and fluid movement.","Procedural Organic Shapes: Generates unique shapes using quadratic curves and randomized deformation parameters.","Interactive Audio: Integrated Web Audio API engine that triggers procedural sound effects based on user interaction.","Real-time Customization: Extensive GUI (via lil-gui) to control blob count, size, gravity, \"organicness\", and layers.","Presets & Sharing: Support for exporting/importing configuration JSON and downloading generated patterns as PNG."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WowkDigital/organic_pattern_generator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc881b136c1474f790159cf3aeb4adeed24ce5d9e301bc2b8446bf8345cdd69f","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:45.086Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:45.086Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An interactive, high-performance web application that generates organic, blob-like patterns using physics simulations and procedural generation. The project features real-time interactivity, generative audio, and advanced customization options for creative coding enthusiasts.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WowkDigital/organic_pattern_generator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"fc881b136c1474f790159cf3aeb4adeed24ce5d9e301bc2b8446bf8345cdd69f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WowkDigital/organic_pattern_generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:45.086Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-03-16T22:06:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WowkDigital/organic_pattern_generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:45.086Z","hash":"fc881b136c1474f790159cf3aeb4adeed24ce5d9e301bc2b8446bf8345cdd69f","originalBytes":2010,"storedBytes":2010,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["audio","organic","procedural","shapes","api","html5","real-time","web","application","canvas","customization","d3.js","engine","example","features","fluid","force-directed","generates","generator","gravity","high-performance","interactive","lil-gui","mobile","pattern","patterns","physics","responsive","simulations","size","touch","using","advanced","animation","art","based","blob","blob-like","browser-based","bubble","built-in","coding","collision","configuration","control","controller","cor